# Long-cache the vendored basemap glyphs + sprites (static/basemaps-assets,
# fetched by MapLibre per the style in src/lib/components/LocationMap.svelte).
# They only change if the vendored protomaps/basemaps-assets copy is refreshed,
# and a refresh must come with a path bump (sprites already carry /v4/; version
# fonts the same way if they are ever updated) — hence immutable is safe.
# adapter-cloudflare copies this file into the build and appends SvelteKit's
# own immutable rules; it must live at the repo root, not under static/.
/basemaps-assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
